description "Sith Operative

^9Weapons:
- Melee
^2-- RoF: 1.09x
- Acidic Vibroknife ^9(Cyan/Blue Saber)
-- Saber Defense (1)
-- Mastery (1)
^2-- Hit: Shock/poison
^1-- Blaster Defense: No
^1-- Chain Limit: 2
^1-- Length: 16
- Sith Blaster Pistol (2)
^2-- Charged Drain: 1.25x
- Thermal Grenade (2)

^3Abilities:
- Saber Throw ^3[Saber CS1]
- Dex Roll ^3[CS2]
- Quick Throw (1) ^3[CS3]
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS4]

^8Attributes:
- Force Block (1)
- Stamina (1)
- Dexterity (1)
- Tracking Beacon
^2- Armor Regen: 1/.5s > 10

Multi-life elite troopers specializing in assassination."